+
+# Rental service availability query
+
+Added `availability({ start, end, kind? })` to the rental service (`src/index.ts`). It returns the sorted
+ids of the equipment of that kind (any kind when omitted) with no booking overlapping the period.
+The overlap test is shared with `book` (`isFree`), so both use the same half-open rule.
+Tests added in `test/rental.test.ts` (red-first: new behaviour); all 15 pass.
+Design choice: see dl-002-availability-validates-its-query-like-quote-and-returns-sorted-ids.
